<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n93616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέλ-ας</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αος</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, τό</span>: <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i> uses (besides nom.) dat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέλαϊ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.739
				</span></i>
			, 
				contr.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέλᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					21.246
				</span></i>
			; gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέλαος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.7.33
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέλατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Conon
					49.2
				</span></i>
			: pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέλᾱ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					395a31
				</span></i>
			, al., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.289
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Bass.
			</span></i>); gen. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελάων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mu.</u>
					395b4
				</span></i>
			 codd. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελῶν</span> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Stob.
			</span></i>):—<i>light, brightness, flame</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.366
				</span></i>
			, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιομένοιο πυρός, π.
				αἰθομένοιο</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				375
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.563
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν σέλαϊ μεγάλῳ</span>,
			without any word added, <i><span class="en">
				17.739
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαΐδων ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.354
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				275
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. λάβρον Ἡφαίστου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ . . λάμπε γυίων ς. ὧτε πυρός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					16.104
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἥφαιστος . . λαμπρὸν ἐκπέμπων
			ς</span>., of a beacon fire, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				281
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				289
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἡφαιστότευκτον</span>, of a
			volcano, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				986
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καμίνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					281
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφέστιον ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				607
			</span></i>; of the heavenly bodies, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. γένετ᾽ ἠΰτε μήνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					19.374
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλίου ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				926
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1711
			</span></i>; of day<i>light</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθαρὸν
				ἁμέρας ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				142.4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				856
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὶν θεοῦ δῦναι ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				469
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ς. καὶ τὸ φῶς ταὐτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					409b
				</span></i>
			; <i>lightning, flash of lightning</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαιόμενον ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.76
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				152
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				95
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἐκ τοῦ οὐρανοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.28
				</span></i>
			; <i>meteor</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				395a31
			</span></i>; <i>torchlight,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Cer.
				52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.808
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.46
			</span></i>, etc., <i>the flash</i> of an angry eye, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ὀμμάτων ἤστραπτε γοργωπὸν ς</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				358
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				663
			</span></i> (so in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄσσε λαμπέσθην ὡς εἴ τε πυρὸς
				ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				19.366
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄσσε δεινὸν ὑπὸ βλεφάρων ὡς
				εἰ ς. ἐξεφάανθεν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				17
			</span></i>): metaph. of love, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				2.134
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.93
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Rhian.
			</span></i>).</div>
